OL,4,BEngland's tearaway quick bowler        
OL,5,Breinvented as a top-order batter       
OL,6,GSportspeople are faced with a question 
OL,7,Gwhen injuries hit again and again. Do  
OL,8,GI try one more time or should I walk   
OL,9,Gaway?                                  
OL,11,FEngland's Katie George came really     
OL,12,Fclose to choosing the latter option    
OL,13,Flast year.                             
OL,15,F"I had a couple of conversations with  
OL,16,Fmy close family and partner about      
OL,17,Fwhether it was taking too much out of  
OL,18,Fme and whether I was happy with the    
OL,19,Fperson I was," she says. "I was pretty 
OL,20,Fmiserable."                            
